### OCR Integration - Testing Endpoints
### Use con REST Client extension (VS Code) o Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = Bearer <jwt_token>
@companyId = 1

###
### 1. Procesar Factura con OCR
### Requiere archivo PDF real
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/invoices
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="factura_ejemplo.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-data/factura.pdf
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="invoiceType"

expense
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

es
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

manual
------FormBoundary--

###
### 2. Verificar Estado del Servicio OCR
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/status
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### 3. Limpiar Archivos Temporales
### (elimina archivos > 7 días antiguos)
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/cleanup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "daysOld": 7
}

###
### FLUJO COMPLETO: Procesar Factura y Extraer Datos Contables
###

### Paso 1: Procesar con OCR
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/invoices
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="factura.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-data/factura.pdf
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="invoiceType"

expense
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

es
------FormBoundary--

###
### Paso 2: Usar ocrText para extracción contable
### (copiar ocrText de la respuesta anterior)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/invoice-extractor/extract
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ocrText": "FACTURA\nEmisor: Acme Corp\nNIF: A12345678\nEmisión: 15/07/2026\nBase: 1000.00 €\nIVA (21%): 210.00 €\nTotal: 1210.00 €",
  "invoiceType": "expense",
  "language": "es",
  "trimestre": "Q3",
  "year": 2026
}

###
### TESTS ADICIONALES
###

### Test: OCR sin autenticación (debe fallar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/invoices
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"

<test
------FormBoundary--

### Test: Archivo no PDF (debe fallar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/invoices
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="documento.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Contenido de texto plano
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="invoiceType"

expense
------FormBoundary--

### Test: Status del servicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/status
Authorization: {{token}}

### Test: Status sin autenticación (debe fallar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/status

### Test: Cleanup sin requerimientos especiales
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/ocr/cleanup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "daysOld": 30
}

###
### EJEMPLO: Procesar factura de gasto
